      "statement": "The repository explicitly supports a no-sign-in local mode by leaving the backend `ENTRA_*` values and frontend `NEXT_PUBLIC_ENTRA_*` values blank, which causes the backend to disable OBO auth and fall back to the local single-identity path.",
