      "id": "claim_265832ef26bd4f72a3ec0c5056f760f3",
      "statement": "`scripts/up-all.sh` is the highest-level local orchestration entrypoint: it performs preflight checks, can create Entra apps and app roles before provisioning, runs `azd up`, and then runs bootstrap explicitly because ingest is slow and data-plane fragile.",
